# SPEC-09 — Production and delivery

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-09-production-delivery.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Shot status is six stages. Review is local annotations plus one Approve. Export presets, loudness, reframe, and the C2PA checkbox are wired. A cryptographic signature needs the cert env. Location search, Mapillary, satellite, and Cesium save a plate the direction card can attach.
